><span class="line"></span><span class="line">IMAGE_PATH=&quot;./screenshots/ui-mockup.png&quot;</span><span class="line"></span><span class="line">agent -p --output-format json \</span><span class="line">  &quot;Analyze this image and provide a detailed description: $IMAGE_PATH&quot; | \</span><span class="line">  jq -r &#x27;.result&#x27;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div>
